# Task 3: IoT Prototype - Motion Detection Alarm System

## Project Overview
This repository contains an IoT prototype simulation for a Motion Detection Alarm System designed using Arduino. The system detects any movement within the sensor's range and triggers an audible alarm (Buzzer) and visual alert (LED).

## System Architecture & Circuit Diagram
Below is the circuit setup designed in Tinkercad:

![Circuit Diagram](path/to/your/circuit-screenshot.png)

## Hardware/Components Simulated
* Arduino Uno R3
* PIR Motion Sensor
* Piezo Buzzer
* Red LED & 220Ω Resistor

